            "start": 507,
            "end": 657,
            "quote": "## 2. [Working with Dynamic Shapes — NVIDIA TensorRT](https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/tensorrt/10.x.x/inference-library/work-dynamic-shapes.html)",
