            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c504e92589a9b6f4232f6b2ccc371e036e6de39e9cf026ea5dd94cf405c2b8a7",
            "start": 400,
            "end": 468,
            "quote": "构建引擎时，通过 `IOptimizationProfile` 为每个动态输入指定 `min / opt / max` 三种 shape",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c504e92589a9b6f4232f6b2ccc371e036e6de39e9cf026ea5dd94cf405c2b8a7",
            "start": 700,
            "end": 789,
            "quote": "推理前必须 `context->setInputShape(name, actualDims)`（TRT 8.x 用 `setBindingDimensions`），否则会报错。",
